# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  iPear Loyalty — Cloudflare Pages Headers
#
#  CRITICAL: Pages matches headers per-path with NO merging — the most-specific
#  rule REPLACES the wildcard. To avoid silently dropping HSTS / CSP on the
#  Clean URLs that Pages serves (/admin, /tablet, etc.), all security headers
#  MUST live in a single /* block. Per-path blocks below only exist where a
#  delta is required (e.g. camera=(self) for tablet QR scanning) and they
#  REPEAT the full security header set verbatim.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── Cache directives (no security headers; safe as per-path) ─────────────
/sw.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache, no-store, must-revalidate

/sw-customer.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache, no-store, must-revalidate

/firebase-messaging-sw.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache, no-store, must-revalidate

/*.html
  Cache-Control: no-cache, must-revalidate

# ── Global security headers — apply to every URL, Clean and .html ────────
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains; preload
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://www.gstatic.com https://apis.google.com https://cdn.jsdelivr.net https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com https://www.googletagmanager.com https://www.google.com https://www.recaptcha.net; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com; font-src 'self' https://fonts.gstatic.com; connect-src 'self' https://*.googleapis.com https://*.firebaseio.com https://*.cloudfunctions.net https://email-worker.ipear2026.workers.dev wss://*.firebaseio.com https://firestore.googleapis.com https://identitytoolkit.googleapis.com https://securetoken.googleapis.com https://firebaseinstallations.googleapis.com https://fcmregistrations.googleapis.com; img-src 'self' data: blob: https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com https://*.firebasestorage.app https://lh3.googleusercontent.com; frame-src https://loyalty-ipear.firebaseapp.com https://apis.google.com https://www.google.com https://www.recaptcha.net; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'

